      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean i get the medical thing but i dont think its just a normal health issue. its like... it feels too specific. like my body is actually tuning into different frequencies. i keep reading about latent genetic traits and how ppl used to have different sensory capabilities before modern life suppressed them. it feels like my biology is trying to adapt or something. do u think it's possible for a person to actually undergo a biological awakening like that?",
